WEBVTT

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:17.930
The legendary duo from the Field of Light...?

00:00:19.670 --> 00:00:21.800
You have nothing to worry about.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.680
Our eternal life starts with 
controlling the Field of Light.

00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.770
Of course.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:32.410
What about the two Prism Stones 
who presence have disappeared...?

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:35.710
I will bring them back to Dotsuku Zone soon.

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:42.260
At this rate, it doesn't look good.

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:43.790
I know.

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:48.630
Deep down, Jyaku-King must 
be growing very impatient.

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:51.640
I told you... I know!

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:53.700
I hope so.

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:55.660
What do you mean by that?

00:00:55.660 --> 00:00:57.500
Do you think I'll fail?

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:01.010
Don't be ridiculous! How could I fail?

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:04.210
I'm going to get those Prism 
Stones, and come back...

00:01:04.210 --> 00:01:05.510
This time for sure.

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:12.020
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:14.690
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:14.820 --> 00:01:17.460
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:17.660 --> 00:01:21.930
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:24.630
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:27.770
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:29.370
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:33.370
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:35.170
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:36.670 --> 00:01:40.980
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot,</i>

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:42.950
<i>we both</i>

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.280
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:46.850
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:50.860
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:53.420
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:53.690 --> 00:01:56.590
<i>Don't you know that good fortune</i>

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:59.160
<i>comes to the gates of laughter?
Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:59.460 --> 00:02:05.340
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:02:05.740 --> 00:02:06.640
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:02:06.640 --> 00:02:09.110
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:12.140
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:12.140 --> 00:02:16.410
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are</i>

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:19.480
<i>Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:23.220
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.390
Do it carefully.

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:29.510
It's a failure.

00:02:29.510 --> 00:02:31.330
That's salt!

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:35.300
Why did we transform where 
there were so many people?

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.780
What if someone saw us?

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:40.540
Is it possible that...

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:44.110
someone here could have seen us?

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:46.080
What am I going to do?

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.440
There's no use thinking about it now...

00:02:48.440 --> 00:02:50.750
We've already done it.

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:54.020
Hey... Did you... Did you hear?

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:55.380
What?

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:57.490
Have you heard of Pretty Cure?

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.460
Pretty Cure...?

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.240
You haven't, have you?

00:03:03.510 --> 00:03:05.340
We heard about them from Kyoto...

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:06.860
Pretty Cure is two girls.

00:03:06.860 --> 00:03:09.930
It seems they fight against bad guys.

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:13.930
Hey! Wait a minute!

00:03:13.930 --> 00:03:15.020
What are you looking at?

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:17.890
And...?

00:03:17.890 --> 00:03:18.880
That's all.

00:03:20.460 --> 00:03:24.060
Unfortunately, that's all we know.

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:24.980
What...?

00:03:25.300 --> 00:03:29.630
But... but I'd like to see and meet them...

00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:30.960
Wouldn't you?

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:35.570
I guess...

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:44.930
"ARE YOU KIDDING? PRETTY CURE IMPOSTERS GO WILD"

00:03:40.950 --> 00:03:43.750
"ARE YOU KIDDING? PRETTY CURE IMPOSTERS GO WILD"

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.900
What are we going to do?

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:48.870
Don't ask me...

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:52.940
Will people find out that we're Pretty Cure?

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:55.160
That day might come.

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:57.350
What are we going to do if it does?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.370
I wouldn't know what to do, but in any case,

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:02.100
we just have to be careful 
that it doesn't happen.

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.590
You're right.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:09.190
You're wrong. Cure Black likes 
strawberry, not vanilla.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.900
What did you just say, Natsuko?

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:14.510
What did I say?

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:17.240
Something about Black...

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:19.610
Oh, you mean about Pretty Cure?

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:21.230
You mean you don't know...?

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:23.250
Most people know about them, don't they?

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.210
Why?

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:27.050
Because...

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.180
They just do!

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:31.180
What? How do you know?

00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:32.150
What's "Pretty Cure"?

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:35.720
Pretty Cure is two people, one 
named Black, the other, White.

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.500
They're defenders of justice.

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:39.070
And...?

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.120
What do you mean?

00:04:40.380 --> 00:04:45.000
What else? You seen to know 
an awful lot about them.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.320
Sure we do.

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:47.820
Don't we?

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.060
What do you know about them?

00:04:52.110 --> 00:04:54.110
Do you promise not to tell anyone?

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:56.540
Can you promise?

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:02.530
According to the rumors, Black is 
quite cute and really cool, but...

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:05.180
White doesn't quite measure up.

00:05:06.370 --> 00:05:07.990
I don't know about that.

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:11.120
I heard White was pretty cool.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.660
And besides, don't you think Black 
seems a bit selfish and spoiled?

00:05:18.070 --> 00:05:18.960
And...?

00:05:19.660 --> 00:05:23.370
Black is glib and pushy.

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:24.940
To put it bluntly, she's self-centered.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:28.130
She didn't seem like that to me.

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:30.920
Especially the way she looked 
before she transformed.

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:34.140
You saw them before they transformed?

00:05:34.990 --> 00:05:35.810
When?

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:37.620
We saw them yesterday, didn't we?

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.750
Yesterday? Where?

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:40.950
Well...

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:42.580
It's a secret.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:43.420
Isn't it?

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:44.670
Please tell me...

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:45.950
Where did you see me...

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.390
I mean... Where did you see Pretty Cure?

00:05:48.730 --> 00:05:50.860
Girls! What are you doing over there?

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:52.830
You're not making any progress at all.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:56.010
Stop moving your mouths, and move your hands!

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:57.400
Yes, ma'am.

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:08.680
You don't have to get so upset.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:11.350
She said I wasn't very 
cute, and I was selfish...

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:12.650
It makes me mad.

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:15.860
Seeing that it's not necessarily off 
the mark, it hurts, doesn't it mepo?

00:06:16.680 --> 00:06:17.840
What's that?

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:20.280
But according to what you're saying, it seems

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:22.830
those girls know a lot 
about Pretty Cure mipo.

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:24.630
That's true mepo.

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:27.800
Cure Black being selfish is 
unmistakably the truth mepo.

00:06:28.140 --> 00:06:30.600
Are you trying to get me mad?

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.140
I'm just kidding mepo.

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.730
You're so cute, Nagisa.

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:35.690
By the way, I'm hungry mepo.

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:40.180
That's the only time you try 
to get on my good side...

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:50.990
Today, we have my special rice omelette.

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.760
That's just what I wanted to eat today mepo!

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:56.190
What about you, Mipple?

00:06:56.190 --> 00:06:57.720
I'm not hungry yet mipo.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:59.730
Overeating is bad for your health mipo!

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:03.450
You should follow Mipple's example, Mepple.

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:05.550
I don't want to hear that from you mepo.

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:08.920
Not eating when you're hungry is 
even worse for your health mepo.

00:07:10.600 --> 00:07:14.440
But didn't those two say they saw 
Pretty Cure yesterday, too, Honoka?

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.350
Think about it...

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:18.990
Did we transform yesterday?

00:07:18.990 --> 00:07:19.980
You're right...

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:21.210
We didn't, did we?

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.480
It's strange, isn't it?

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.690
Sorry, you two...

00:07:24.690 --> 00:07:26.320
Letting you watch my shop while I was away.

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.860
It was a great help.

00:07:29.860 --> 00:07:32.760
Will you have more "takoyaki" 
(octopus dumplings) before you go?

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.270
Can we?

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:35.230
Lucky!

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:40.270
Is Pretty Cure something popular these days?

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:45.210
I really hope not...

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:46.680
How do you know about them, Akane-san?

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:49.110
They're a pair who transform, 
and call themselves

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:50.980
"White" and "Black," aren't they?

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:52.860
How do you know about them?

00:07:52.860 --> 00:07:54.570
I saw them... with my own two eyes.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:57.620
Why are you so surprised?

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:58.650
You saw them?

00:07:59.150 --> 00:07:59.990
When?

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:00.640
Where?

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.100
Over there... at the children's playground.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:04.750
Let's see... I saw them yesterday.

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:07.600
They stood in front of 
the children, and said,

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:10.270
"Hurry and go back to where you came from,"

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:11.570
or something like that.

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.350
I never said "hurry."

00:08:14.350 --> 00:08:16.250
Are they some kind of comedy team?

00:08:16.250 --> 00:08:17.380
No way!

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:19.340
What's going on anyway?

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:22.680
Why do you look so serious?

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.550
If you're so interested, why 
don't you go and see them?

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:26.000
They're probably doing it again today.

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:30.680
"Hurry and go back to where you came from."

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:34.090
It just can't be!

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:39.530
Does that mean there are imposters mepo?

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.690
Give me a break.

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:43.330
It's causing a commotion.

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.690
Rather than that...

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:48.310
If that's true, then it's dangerous.

00:08:48.550 --> 00:08:49.870
I agree with you mipo.

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:52.780
If those guys from Dotsuku Zone come 
after them, it'll be terrible mipo.

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:56.210
They have no idea, and they're 
letting it go to their heads.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:57.610
I wonder who it could be.

00:08:57.610 --> 00:08:59.220
Could it be...?

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:05.950
Look! Over there!

00:09:05.950 --> 00:09:06.920
You're kidding!

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:08.550
Kyoko! Natsuko!

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:10.780
I thought so.

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:12.560
What do you two think you're doing?

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:18.260
There's a good reason for doing this...

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:19.490
Isn't there, Kyoko?

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:26.060
When you said Black was cute, 
were you talking about yourself?

00:09:26.060 --> 00:09:27.840
You figured it out?

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:29.400
Then White is...

00:09:30.230 --> 00:09:30.980
Don't I look good?

00:09:32.670 --> 00:09:34.290
Bye-bye, Pretty Cure.

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:36.650
See you again!

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.120
Shall we go?

00:09:39.990 --> 00:09:40.750
Wait a minute!

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.930
Why are you dressed like that?

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:48.370
It was about a week ago...

00:09:48.370 --> 00:09:51.830
It's the truth! I'm Pretty Cure Black.

00:09:51.830 --> 00:09:54.010
Why won't you believe me?

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:55.860
Because Natsuko...

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.480
Okay, then... Transform 
right here, and show me.

00:09:58.480 --> 00:10:01.400
Pretty Cure transform now!

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.250
You know I can't do it.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.750
You're funny, Natsuko.

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.470
What's "Pretty Cure"?

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:19.530
They're two girls who transform, 
and fight the evil villains...

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:20.700
Do they really exist?

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.510
Haven't you heard about them?

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:25.500
They were in action just the other day.

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:27.470
How do you know that?

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:30.270
That's because I'm Pretty Cure.

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:32.010
You're lying!

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:34.240
I tell you... It's the truth.

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:37.800
Wouldn't you all like to meet Pretty Cure?

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:38.910
Yes, we do.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:40.140
We do. We do!

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:42.290
Next time, I'll transform and show you.

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:43.630
Really?

00:10:43.630 --> 00:10:45.640
Can I bring my friends?

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:46.510
Sure...

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:48.140
Is it a promise?

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:49.730
I promise.

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:52.790
Yeah!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.830
We're going to see Pretty Cure.

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:58.410
Are you sure it's okay to promise them that?

00:10:58.410 --> 00:10:59.730
Don't worry.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:08.360
Pretty Cure Transformation!

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:11.580
Hurry and go back to where you came from.

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:12.530
That's so cool.

00:11:12.530 --> 00:11:14.050
You'll come again tomorrow, won't you?

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:16.420
If you're a good girl.

00:11:16.930 --> 00:11:20.190
Be sure to brush your teeth 
before you go to bed.

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:26.830
Is that what happened?

00:11:27.280 --> 00:11:28.800
What about those costumes?

00:11:28.800 --> 00:11:30.480
Isn't it well done?

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:31.850
We made them ourselves.

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.270
We stayed up all night.

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:36.740
I understand, but I think you should stop.

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:38.710
Why?

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.030
Because...

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:42.670
We're just thinking of you...

00:11:42.670 --> 00:11:44.550
Why do we have to stop?

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:45.550
I don't like this.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.800
It's none of your business, is it?

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:48.910
Let's go, Natsuko.

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:51.190
Wait!

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:54.380
Just let them be.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:55.840
We can't do that, can we?

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:59.200
What if they're mistaken for us, and 
they're attacked by those evil people?

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:03.500
We don't have any choice, do we?

00:12:06.730 --> 00:12:08.150
They found us.

00:12:08.150 --> 00:12:09.910
Our secret is out... There's 
nothing we can do about it.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:13.600
It's not like we're causing 
any trouble for those two.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:14.410
That's right.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.480
Shall we have tea?

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:42.190
Where did they go?

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:45.410
Were Kyoko and Natsuko 
that quick on their feet?

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:49.350
Nagisa! Over there!

00:12:55.570 --> 00:12:57.350
What are they doing there?

00:12:57.350 --> 00:12:59.340
I have a bad feeling about this mepo.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:00.860
I do, too mipo!

00:13:00.860 --> 00:13:02.490
Anyway, let's go up there, and take a look.

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:16.440
Natsuko! Kyoko!

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.170
What are you doing up here anyway?

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:23.740
It's dangerous, so let's go down...

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:25.620
What are you doing?

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.590
Let me go, Natsuko!

00:13:28.460 --> 00:13:29.550
What's going on?

00:13:36.610 --> 00:13:40.230
I guess you don't know what you've 
gotten yourselves into, do you?

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:56.480
Natsuko! Pull yourself together!

00:13:59.280 --> 00:14:01.420
What's wrong? Get up!

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:05.070
They're being manipulated mipo!

00:14:05.070 --> 00:14:06.460
Hurry, and transform mipo!

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:18.840
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:09.720
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:12.590
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:16.460
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:19.860
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:23.300
Go back to where you came from!

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.720
I've had enough of your pompous talk!

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:32.040
I'd like to enjoy watching Pretty 
Cure battle against Pretty Cure.

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:34.250
Go! My Pretty Cure.

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:45.940
Let me go, Natsuko!

00:15:53.940 --> 00:15:56.400
What's wrong, Black? Are you okay?

00:15:56.750 --> 00:15:58.870
It's not me...

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:04.140
Pull yourself together, Natsuko.

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:07.830
That's right. We must 
take care of our friends.

00:16:07.830 --> 00:16:09.470
You can both fall down together.

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:14.720
Black!

00:16:15.500 --> 00:16:16.690
You're so softhearted.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:21.690
Thank goodness.

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.590
Behind you, White!

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:27.640
Don't!

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:35.410
What are you doing?

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:44.270
What are we going to do?

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.980
We can't fight against them.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:50.160
Kyoko! Natsuko! Wake up!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:51.460
Come to your senses!

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:56.300
No matter what you say, it's useless.

00:17:00.960 --> 00:17:02.100
What are you doing?

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.010
She wouldn't...!

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:09.470
Stop! It's dangerous!

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:11.870
Stop it, Natsuko!

00:17:11.870 --> 00:17:13.200
Pull yourself together!

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:14.450
You're going to fall!

00:17:16.390 --> 00:17:19.230
Trying to save them and trying to run away...

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:20.890
You sure are busy!

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:22.290
You'll have to pick one or the other,

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:23.860
or you'll be running around 
in circles forever!

00:17:24.310 --> 00:17:25.320
You coward!

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:28.130
I'd rather be called a strategist.

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:30.600
Fight us fair and square.

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:32.030
Are you serious?

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:34.340
I guess it's time I got serious then.

00:17:44.260 --> 00:17:46.530
Pull yourself together, Natsuko!

00:17:46.530 --> 00:17:48.610
Hurry, and wake up!

00:17:53.690 --> 00:17:54.700
Where...

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:56.580
...am I?

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:03.040
Hurry!

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:03.800
This way!

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:21.010
Running around like that! 
You're like cockroaches.

00:18:23.080 --> 00:18:24.480
What did you say?

00:18:27.750 --> 00:18:30.750
I'll give those two a taste of fear.

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:33.420
Destroy them, Zakenna...

00:18:35.730 --> 00:18:36.760
We...?

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:46.430
What are you doing?

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:48.570
Get all four of them now!

00:18:58.550 --> 00:18:59.770
I'm scared!

00:18:59.770 --> 00:19:01.740
Help!

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.770
Natsuko! Kyoko!

00:19:05.070 --> 00:19:06.570
Pull yourselves together.

00:19:06.570 --> 00:19:08.360
You're Pretty Cure, aren't you?

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:11.160
That's right. The children are 
waiting for you, aren't they?

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:12.170
So hang in there!

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:14.800
All right.

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:24.140
I can't take it anymore.

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:29.830
That's enough!

00:19:29.830 --> 00:19:31.850
These two have nothing to 
do with this, do they?

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:35.490
So who cares what happens to them?

00:19:35.490 --> 00:19:39.860
If you'll just hand over the Prism 
Stones, I'm willing to save them.

00:19:40.930 --> 00:19:42.140
What a lowlife!

00:19:42.140 --> 00:19:43.130
I won't forgive you.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:45.130
Then what are you going to do?

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:46.600
You have nowhere to run.

00:19:49.810 --> 00:19:51.440
Prepare yourselves.

00:19:57.630 --> 00:19:59.130
Now you've really made me mad!

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:02.210
Black Thunder!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:04.680
White Thunder!

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:15.630
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.460
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:20:19.550 --> 00:20:23.000
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.790
Pull yourself together, Natsuko!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:45.660
Pull yourself together.

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:57.150
Thank goodness.

00:20:57.150 --> 00:20:58.270
Are you okay?

00:20:58.610 --> 00:20:59.510
We...

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:02.380
Where's Pretty Cure?

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:05.510
Pretty Cure?

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:08.480
Pretty Cure saved us.

00:21:08.810 --> 00:21:11.910
When we got here, no one was here.

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:12.950
Right?

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:17.920
What are you doing here anyway?

00:21:19.340 --> 00:21:21.340
Was it a dream?

00:21:23.350 --> 00:21:24.710
Shall we give it up?

00:21:25.300 --> 00:21:28.000
You mean you're thinking 
the same thing I was?

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:30.520
Nagisa and Honoka were right.

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:34.870
I'm not going to imitate Pretty Cure anymore.

00:21:34.870 --> 00:21:36.590
We won't spread rumors either.

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:39.420
There's no way we can become 
the real Pretty Cure.

00:21:41.090 --> 00:21:44.490
I don't really know what's going on, 
but I think it's great... Don't you?

00:21:45.410 --> 00:21:48.290
I'm glad.

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:53.800
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:21:53.800 --> 00:21:55.340
Cure White!

00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:57.680
Pretty Cure Transformation!

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:01.490
What shall we do?

00:22:01.490 --> 00:22:02.810
What can we do?

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:08.970
Hurry and go back to where you came from!

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:12.940
I told you, I don't use the word "hurry."

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:14.760
Hurry...!

00:22:15.990 --> 00:22:18.750
...and go back to where you came from!

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:25.320
<i>Let's go!</i>

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:26.860
<i>Get you!</i>

00:22:26.860 --> 00:22:29.560
<i>L-O-V-E Love Love, get you!</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.300
<i>I can't do this!</i>

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>I'd rather be a young lady than a fighter and</i>

00:22:35.570 --> 00:22:38.000
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:42.140
<i>And melt your body and soul into sweets</i>

00:22:44.680 --> 00:22:47.850
<i>like chocolate parfait or handsome men</i>

00:22:47.910 --> 00:22:51.580
<i>I'm at the age to seriously 
fall head over heels in love</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:55.320
<i>I wanted to confess my love again today</i>

00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:59.690
<i>For the sake of the earth 
For the sake of everyone</i>

00:22:59.820 --> 00:23:06.330
<i>That's good, too, but haven't 
you forgotten something?</i>

00:23:07.430 --> 00:23:10.700
<i>I'm a teenager with a</i>

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:13.940
<i>heart throbbing exciting dream</i>

00:23:13.940 --> 00:23:16.670
<i>I don't want to lose that</i>

00:23:16.670 --> 00:23:20.450
<i>normal everyday routine</i>

00:23:20.450 --> 00:23:22.950
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:23.180 --> 00:23:26.420
<i>It's romance rather than stress, isn't it?</i>

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.590
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:31.890
<i>Isn't that the best source of power?</i>

00:23:32.190 --> 00:23:34.930
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:23:35.390 --> 00:23:38.200
<i>I'd rather cuddle than fight and...</i>

00:23:38.200 --> 00:23:40.430
<i>Get you! Into a love love mode</i>

00:23:40.430 --> 00:23:42.970
<i>That's the most peaceful way</i>

00:23:43.100 --> 00:23:44.370
<i>So why am I</i>

00:23:44.500 --> 00:23:45.970
<i>stuffing my face</i>

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:49.670
<i>with chocolates like this?</i>

00:23:53.980 --> 00:23:55.320
We're going on a trip.

00:23:55.320 --> 00:23:56.820
I'm going somewhere with my grandmother, too.

00:23:56.820 --> 00:23:58.130
We're staying at a lakeside hotel.

00:23:58.130 --> 00:23:59.480
We're staying at a Japanese-style inn.

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:01.040
There's a huge lake...

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:02.710
And the island that appears...

00:24:02.710 --> 00:24:04.410
...has an old legend.

00:24:04.410 --> 00:24:05.860
Together?

00:24:05.860 --> 00:24:07.560
What is this new development?

00:24:07.560 --> 00:24:08.500
Not again?

00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:11.030
No way!

00:24:12.070 --> 00:24:15.500
"A REALLY DANGEROUS FAMILY VACATION"

00:24:15.500 --> 00:24:16.650
The old legend...?

00:24:17.000 --> 00:24:17.810
That's about...

00:24:17.810 --> 00:24:18.700
Buried treasure?

